{
  "id": 8833360691399,
  "title": "Nature Tree of Life Quilt Set with Stained Glass Pattern And Bedroom",
  "handle": "nature-tree-of-life-quilt-set-with-stained-glass-pattern-and-bedroom-2eedde5b65-2eedde5b65",
  "body_html": "<p>Embrace the symbolic beauty and serene energy of the Tree of Life with this custom quilt set by Jeminise. Perfect for nature lovers, this bedding set features an artistic Celtic design that brings warmth and farmhouse charm to any bedroom. Whether you are using it as a lightweight layer in the summer or for cozy comfort during the winter, this versatile quilt is designed to provide year-round comfort.</p><h3>Key Features</h3><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Personalized Design:</strong> Customize every aspect of this quilt, including the background, framing color, and text saying squares with your own words or loved ones' names.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Soft &amp; Cozy Feel:</strong> Crafted with a breathable, soft 100% polyester outer layer and filled with high-quality silk floss for lightweight warmth and long-lasting comfort.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Included Components:</strong> Features one custom quilt with optional coordinating pillowcases to complete your personalized bedding set.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Versatile Use:</strong> Highly functional as a bed quilt, cozy throw blanket, backyard picnic mat, or camping companion.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Machine washable and designed to resist pilling, fading, and wrinkling, maintaining its softness and vibrant colors with ease.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Thoughtful Gift:</strong> An exceptional custom present for moms, dads, men, and women on Christmas, Valentine's Day, Mother's Day, or Father's Day.</li>\n</ul><h3>Product Specifications</h3><table><tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Quilt Set</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fill Material</th>\n<td>Silk Floss</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Style</th>\n<td>Farmhouse</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Tree of Life, Flowers</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Tree of Life, Yggdrasil</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Included Components</th>\n<td>1 Quilt + Pillowcases (Optional)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Customization</th>\n<td>1 text input</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Available Sizes</th>\n<td>Throw (60x70 inches), Twin (68x86 inches), Full (80x90 inches), Queen (90x90 inches), King (91x102 inches)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>",
